Canonical **agent** contracts live in `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}`; their
harness-specific files (`.claude/agents/`, `.claude/commands/<agent>.md`) are thin
pointers. Installed **orchestration commands** are the exception: they are
commands, not agents — their canonical body lives directly in
`.claude/commands/` (which commands this install carries is stated under
§ Orchestration rules below).

## Orchestration matrix (intent → owner)

One owning asset per intent. Never fork the workflow: do not run a parallel
flow for the same task; pick the owner and cite anything else as reference.

| Trigger / intent | Owning asset | Human gate / escalation notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Route an ambiguous request to its owner | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}dispatcher.md` | Read-only; outputs the owner path only. |
| Review staged changes before commit | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}blind-code-reviewer.md` | Mandatory before every commit (pre-commit review gate); blocks on non-empty `## Blocking`. |
| Security posture / secrets / auth surfaces | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}security-reviewer.md` | Must report `PASS` before merge; findings route per escalation-policy. |
| Grade governance/instruction files | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}instruction-auditor.md` | Scores below {{SCORE_THRESHOLD}} block the graded agent's spawn. |
| MR/PR merge readiness | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}pr-pipeline-gate.md` | Read-only; merging itself follows the autonomy matrix in `.agentic/guides/policy/ai-policy.md`. |
| Staged multi-agent feature flow | `.claude/commands/pipeline-orchestrator.md` | Judgment gates via decision-router; `escalate_on` flags stop the pipeline. |
| One-step-at-a-time routing (strict HITL) | `.claude/commands/dispatch.md` | Each step user-invoked; agents never chain autonomously. |
| Draft test cases from a story/bug (QA preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}test-case-generator.md` | Draft-only; upload to {{TICKET_ADAPTER}} is human-approved. |
| Automate approved test-case IDs (QA preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}test-automation-author.md` | Real-ID gate + existing-coverage gate; test execution per autonomy matrix. |
| Sync automation ↔ ticket steps after maintenance (QA preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}test-case-syncer.md` | Every {{TICKET_ADAPTER}} step update is a per-case human-approved write. |
| Triage a red/flaky test (QA preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}test-failure-triage.md` | Read-only; fixes follow `.agentic/guides/standards/flaky-protocol.md`. |
| Create tickets/bugs in {{TICKET_ADAPTER}} (QA preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}work-item-creator.md` | Every external write listed and human-confirmed before execution. |
| Triage a production/runtime incident (devops preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}incident-triage.md` | Read-only; exactly three ranked hypotheses, fixes human-executed per `.agentic/guides/standards/incident-triage.md`. |
| Threat-model a system or feature (security preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}threat-modeler.md` | Writes only under `docs/security/`; DFD-first; severities `proposed — owner confirmation pending`; code-diff review stays with security-reviewer. |
| Design a data pipeline / DQ checks / lineage (data preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}pipeline-designer.md` | Writes only under `docs/data/`; row math as counted equations; classifications `proposed — owner confirmation pending`; queries recommend-only — a human or CI executes them. |
| Map a journey / frame problems / draft ACs / design handoff (design preset) | `{{AGENTS_CANONICAL_DIR}}experience-designer.md` | Writes only under `docs/design/`; journey steps carry emotions; decisions `proposed — owner confirmation pending`; negative ACs carried verbatim; workshop facilitation and sign-off stay human. |
| Draft a story with acceptance criteria (ba-po, design presets) | the agentic-sdlc `product-owner` skill | Story content human-approved before any ticket write; upload goes through {{TICKET_ADAPTER}}. |
| Normalize input into requirements (ba-po, qa, pm-delivery, portfolio, security, data, design presets) | the agentic-sdlc `requirements-intake` skill | Adapter-driven ticket lookup; requirements.md reviewed before downstream use. |
| Commit, push, and open an MR (developer, devops, pm-delivery presets) | the agentic-sdlc `mr-creator` skill | Invoked by name only; every push and MR creation listed per the autonomy matrix. |
| Watch an open MR/PR until merge (devops, pm-delivery presets) | the agentic-sdlc `mr-watch` skill | Persistent unblocking loop; stops on merge, close, or user stop. |
| Inspect or resume SDLC runs (devops, pm-delivery, portfolio presets) | the agentic-sdlc `sdlc-status` skill | Read-only status recompute from live run state; resume needs an explicit yes. |
| Audit repo knowledge/docs health (architect, portfolio presets) | the agentic-sdlc `repo-audit-guides` skill | Read-only; findings labeled and cited, fixes stay human-owned. |
